@startuml
title Website Development

[*] --> StartMerge

state StartMerge <<choice>>
state "Navigation Bar" as NavigationBar
state "Project View" as ProjectView
state "Photo View" as PhotoView
state "Video View" as VideoView
state "Career Opportunities" as CareerOpportunities
state "Updates View" as UpdatesView
state "Application Form" as ApplicationForm

NavigationBar : entry / To Action
NavigationBar : do / Navigate to project or career opportunities
NavigationBar : exit / User navigated to a new page

ProjectView : entry / Project selected by user
ProjectView : do / Display information about the project
ProjectView --> PhotoView : View photos
ProjectView --> VideoView : Watch videos

PhotoView : entry / Photos selected by user
PhotoView : do / Display photos of the project
PhotoView : exit / User viewed photos

VideoView : entry / Videos selected by user
VideoView : do / Play videos about the project
VideoView : exit / User watched videos

CareerOpportunities : entry / Career opportunities selected by user
CareerOpportunities : do / Display information about career opportunities
CareerOpportunities --> UpdatesView : View updates
CareerOpportunities --> ApplicationForm : Open application form

UpdatesView : entry / Updates selected by user
UpdatesView : do / Display updates about career opportunities
UpdatesView : exit / User viewed updates

ApplicationForm : entry / Application form opened by user
ApplicationForm : do / Allow user to submit job applications
ApplicationForm : exit / User submitted job application

StartMerge --> NavigationBar
NavigationBar --> ProjectView
ProjectView --> PhotoView
ProjectView --> VideoView
CareerOpportunities --> UpdatesView
CareerOpportunities --> ApplicationForm

UpdatesView --> [*]
ApplicationForm --> [*]

@enduml
